# .forceignore
# Exclude metadata that should not be retrieved or deployed from this repository.
# Uses .gitignore syntax. Applied by `sf project retrieve/deploy` commands.
# See: https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.sfdx_dev.meta/sfdx_dev/sfdx_dev_exclude_source.htm

# =============================================================================
# Managed Packages
# Add prefixes for installed managed packages. Their metadata is read-only and
# should not be version-controlled or deployed from this repository.
# =============================================================================

# Example: Pardot / Account Engagement
# **/pi__*

# Example: Salesforce DevOps Center
# **/sf_devops__*

# Example: Internal Salesforce integrations
# **/sfdcInternalInt__*

# Example: Data Cloud connectors
# **/cdp_crm_dk*
# **/cdpactvstrgptnr*
# **/ssot__*

# Object translations for managed-package objects. These are named
# "<StandardObject>-<prefix>__<locale>", so the prefix is not at the start of
# the basename and the patterns above do not match them. Add one line per
# prefix excluded above:
# **/objectTranslations/*-pi__*
# **/objectTranslations/*-sf_devops__*
# **/objectTranslations/*-ssot__*

# =============================================================================
# Org-specific noise (add as needed)
# =============================================================================

# Installed package definitions (managed externally, not deployable)
**/installedPackages

# Example: DevOps Center Named Credentials (auto-generated per sandbox)
# **/namedCredentials/a0Y*
